'''GOLD RUSH''' (ゴールデンウィークイベント, ''Gōruden Uīku Ibento'', '''Golden Week Event''') is held annually during public holidays in Japan. It was added in [[Version 6.0 Update|Version 6.0]].

==Event Information==
The GOLD RUSH is here! Do YOU have the Midas touch?!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''From April 27th (11am) to May 11th (11am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF9900|''' ●Event-Only Stages!'''}}<br>
The streets of the Cat Empire are paved in gold, only for a limited time! Check out these limited stages with wild new enemies and cool rewards!<br>
Visit Stories of Legend/Event Stages to challenge limited map {{Color|#FF0000|'''The Midas Touch'''}}!

Clear any stage in this event map throughout this campaign to pick up Lucky Tickets, good for awesome rewards at the special Lucky Capsules! Stages in the second half of the Midas Touch map will have an even higher chance of rewarding you with a Lucky Ticket!

※ If the event fails to appear, make sure that your Battle Cats app is updated to the most recent version.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Lucky Capsules!'''}}<br>
Get special Cats, items, and XP packs from these limited edition capsules! Check out the {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Lucky Capsules'''}} section on the Cat Base menu to use your collected {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Lucky Tickets'''}} from {{Color|#FF0000|'''The Midas Touch'''}} event! Plus, get a {{Color|#FF00FF|'''bonus Lucky Ticket'''}} along with any {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Rare Capsule'''}} draw!

※ The Lucky Capsules option will appear after you own at least one Lucky Ticket.<br>
※ Lucky Tickets owned will be held over for the next event even after the current Lucky Capsules event ends.<br>
※ If the Lucky Capsules do not appear, please update your Battle Cats app to the most recent version.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● Special Missions in the Catnip Challenges!'''}}<br>
Take on Special Mission challenges and earn delicious bonus rewards by playing limited-time-only Midas Touch events!

※Midas Touch Special Missions will only appear in the Catnip Challenges until May 13, 2024 at 10:59am. You must accept all rewards before the mission disappears at the end of the Catnip Challenges event!

